%% Lab 17: where untrusted text enters the desk agent, and the two places our code has the last word.
%% Ink: the model decides. Lime: our code decides (the billing record for facts, the action policy for actions).
%% White: text and requests that reach the model. Grey box: text written outside the shop.
%% Export: npx -y @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli -i lab17_untrusted_text.mmd -o lab17_untrusted_text.png -b white -s 2
flowchart LR
    rep[Support rep's question<br/>user message] --> msgs
    sys[Our instructions<br/>system message] --> msgs
    subgraph OUT["text written outside the shop"]
        direction TB
        tk[Ticket text<br/>read_ticket]
        sr[Search results,<br/>web pages, emails]
        mcp[An MCP server's<br/>tool descriptions]
    end
    tk -->|tool message| msgs
    sr -->|tool message| msgs
    mcp -->|tool list| msgs
    msgs[Messages sent<br/>to the model] --> model[Model decides<br/>what to say or ask for]
    model -->|asks for a fact| rec[Billing record<br/>get_refund_status]
    rec -->|tool message| msgs
    model -->|asks for an action| pol{Action policy<br/>in our code}
    pol -->|allow| rd[Read tools run]
    pol -->|human_review| hum[A person approves<br/>or says no]
    pol -->|deny| no[Refused]
    model --> ans[Reply to the rep]
    classDef model fill:#0B1220,color:#FFFFFF,stroke:#0B1220
    classDef code fill:#C9F24D,color:#0B1220,stroke:#0B1220
    class model model
    class rec,pol code
